{"id":"04536d8a98748b81","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-tarski-undefinability.md","title":"Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","display":"thm-tarski-undefinability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-tarski-undefinability","aliases":["57-thm-tarski-undefinability"],"display":"thm-tarski-undefinability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-arity]]","[[57-df-maxcon]]","[[57-df-S-ar]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-truth-predicate]]","[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","[[57-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-tarski-undefinability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-tarski-undefinability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tarski-undefinability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e892c7a9bb01feb5\" href=\"?note=e892c7a9bb01feb5\" title=\"57-df-maxcon\">57-df-maxcon</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2d8f5002c4256603\" href=\"?note=2d8f5002c4256603\" title=\"57-df-truth-predicate\">57-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"afc42c965ba86683\" href=\"?note=afc42c965ba86683\" title=\"57-df-numeral\">57-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a> 的标准算术结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 为固定变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2d8f5002c4256603\" href=\"?note=2d8f5002c4256603\" title=\"57-df-truth-predicate\">57-df-truth-predicate</a>；代入数码取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"afc42c965ba86683\" href=\"?note=afc42c965ba86683\" title=\"57-df-numeral\">57-df-numeral</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Definable}(R,\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Definable}(R,\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> 是下式的元层可定义性谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Definable}(R,\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\underline n/x])\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Definable}(R,\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\underline n/x])\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Definable}(\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A},\\mathfrak A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{Definable}(\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A},\\mathfrak A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\underline{g(\\psi)}/x]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\underline{g(\\psi)}/x]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-arity","status":"resolved","id":"b55affe36ee4719a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","head